      #|  (IMAGE FST k CROSS IMAGE SND k) INTER\n       {x,x | x IN topspace top /\\ ~(x:A = a)} =\n      IMAGE (\\x:A. x,x) (IMAGE FST k INTER IMAGE SND k)
